From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: N0zoM1z0 <161784452+N0zoM1z0@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sat, 14 Nov 2026 23:21:22 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] Link MAIN.EXE in its original object order

MAIN.EXE is now identical to the original as a whole file. The order of
the relocation table follows ZUN's object order: a first module only
declares the segments (so main_01 stays word-aligned), then main()'s TU
with its own data, then th02_main.asm. regist_m.cpp now defines its data,
and the data of the later TUs moved into main_dtl.asm after it.
